  "body": "c.f. #3064 ..\r\n\r\n> app_name is only used as a fallback\r\n\r\n& \r\n> host your own Riot and change the brand setting\r\n\r\nWe do host our own Riot, but it this is an actual problem when people use the desktop (or possibly mobile) client to enable mail notifications..\r\nThere should be a setting to enforce app_name regardless of app used to active mail notifs. It possibly should even be made the default setting. If app_name is set, obey it, and fall back to the client's name only if it isn't..",
